  {lv:14, stage:"dialog", q:"A: Would you mind if I opened the window?\nB: ( )", c:["Not at all, go ahead.", "It's mine.", "Yes, please.", "At home."], a:0, kw:"許可", em:"🪟", yaku:"「窓を開けてもかまいませんか。」「もちろん、どうぞ。」", rel:[], exp:"会話の流れに合う返事を選ぶ。"},
  {lv:14, stage:"dialog", q:"A: I can't believe I failed the test again.\nB: ( )", c:["Don't give up. You'll do better next time.", "It's Monday.", "At six.", "Yes, please."], a:0, kw:"励まし", em:"📝", yaku:"「また試験に落ちるなんて信じられない。」「あきらめないで。次はもっとできるよ。」", rel:[], exp:"会話の流れに合う返事を選ぶ。"},
