  {lv:14, stage:"dialog", q:"A: I'm thinking about studying abroad next year.\nB: ( )", c:["That's a great opportunity!", "It's mine.", "Yes, I can.", "At home."], a:0, kw:"将来の計画", em:"🌏", yaku:"「来年留学しようかと考えているんだ。」「それは素晴らしい機会だね！」", rel:[], exp:"会話の流れに合う返事を選ぶ。"},
  {lv:14, stage:"dialog", q:"A: Could you give me some advice on my presentation?\nB: ( )", c:["Sure, let's go over it together.", "It's Monday.", "Yes, please.", "At six."], a:0, kw:"アドバイス", em:"📊", yaku:"「プレゼンについてアドバイスをもらえますか。」「もちろん、一緒に見直しましょう。」", rel:[], exp:"会話の流れに合う返事を選ぶ。"},
  {lv:14, stage:"dialog", q:"A: I've been feeling stressed about exams lately.\nB: ( )", c:["Maybe you should take a short break.", "It's mine.", "Yes, I do.", "At home."], a:0, kw:"心配", em:"😓", yaku:"「最近試験のことでストレスを感じているんだ。」「少し休憩したほうがいいかもね。」", rel:[], exp:"会話の流れに合う返事を選ぶ。"},
  {lv:14, stage:"dialog", q:"A: Do you think it's going to rain later?\nB: ( )", c:["The forecast says it might.", "It's Monday.", "Yes, please.", "At six."], a:0, kw:"天気", em:"🌦️", yaku:"「あとで雨が降ると思う？」「天気予報では降るかもって。」", rel:[], exp:"会話の流れに合う返事を選ぶ。"},
